"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 何か用？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_00"
msgid "You need something?"
msgstr "Чого тобі?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 貴様が「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」か？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_01"
msgid "Are you Ragna the Bloodedge?"
msgstr "Ти і є Раґна Бладедж?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ……違います、人違いです。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_02"
msgid "...No. You have the wrong person."
msgstr "...Ні. Ти мене з кимось сплутав."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 私は第七機関の者だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_03"
msgid "I am from Sector Seven."
msgstr "Я із Сектора Сім."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」、貴様を拘束する。
#. JA:   おとなしくしていれば事は早く済むぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_04"
msgid ""
"Ragna the Bloodedge, I have orders to restrain you.\n"
"I'd prefer it if you came quietly. If you don't resist, I won't\n"
"have to hurt you."
msgstr ""
"Раґно Бладедж, я тебе затримаю. Не опирайся — і все\n"
"швидко скінчиться."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 人の話聞けよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_05"
msgid "You didn't hear a word I said, did you?"
msgstr "Ти взагалі мене слухав?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 貴様が「蒼」の魔道書を持っている以上、
#. JA:   測位システムに反応するなというのが間違いだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_06"
msgid ""
"You've got the Azure Grimoire with you.\n"
"You must have known you'd show up on our EADAP."
msgstr ""
"Раз у тебе Лазурний гримуар, дивно було б сподіватися,\n"
"що система визначення координат тебе не засіче."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 第七機関を、アナログな統制機構の同類と思ってもらっては困る。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_07"
msgid ""
"I do hope you're not mistaking Sector Seven for that\n"
"subpar Librarium."
msgstr ""
"Не рівняй Сектор Сім із тією застарілою Організацією\n"
"контролю."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: はー……で、どうするんだ「赤鬼」さんよ？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_08"
msgid "*sigh* So, what're you gonna do, Mr. Red Devil?"
msgstr "Ха-а... І що робитимеш, пане «Червоний демоне»?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ！？
#. JA:   ふ、私の事を知っているというのならば話は早い。
#. JA:   気乗りはしないが、力ずくでということになるな。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_09"
msgid ""
"So you know of me, then? I suppose I can dispense with\n"
"the formalities. I'd hoped I wouldn't have to force you, but\n"
"you've given me no choice."
msgstr ""
"!? Хм. Якщо ти знаєш, хто я, то все простіше. Не хотілося,\n"
"але доведеться взяти тебе силою."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ぐぅっ、さすが「蒼」の魔道書の所有者なだけはあるな。
#. JA:   見込みが甘かったようだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_10"
msgid ""
"Guh...I should've expected this...from the man who carries\n"
"the Azure Grimoire.  A fatal...miscalculation..."
msgstr ""
"Кх... Недарма ти власник Лазурного гримуара. Схоже, я\n"
"тебе недооцінив."

#. Key: ArcEveRG01_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: メチャメチャ硬ぇ、何でできてやがるんだ。
#. JA:   ったく余計な時間とらせんじゃねーよ、この馬鹿。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG01_11"
msgid ""
"Goddammit. That was like hitting a rock. The hell are you\n"
"made of? Ugh, I'm not gonna waste any more time on you,\n"
"asshole."
msgstr ""
"Твердий, зараза... З чого ти взагалі зроблений? Чорт, не\n"
"змушуй мене марнувати час, ідіоте."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 挨拶もなしで斬りかかるのかい？
#. JA:   はははっ、相変わらず無茶ばかりしてるみたいだね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_00"
msgid ""
"Come on, is that any way to greet someone?\n"
"Hahaha, looks like you're as reckless as ever."
msgstr ""
"І це замість привітання — одразу рубати? Ха-ха-ха, ти,\n"
"схоже, й досі такий самий відчайдуха."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: まったく、昔と何も変わってないんだから。でも少し安心したよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_01"
msgid ""
"You haven't changed at all, although I have to admit I'm a\n"
"little relieved."
msgstr "Анітрохи не змінився. Хоча я трохи заспокоївся."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: なんでテメェがここにいやがる！
#. JA:   いや、そんなことよりテメェには聞きたいことが山ほどある！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_02"
msgid ""
"What the hell are you doing here!? No, never mind that.\n"
"I've got a whole bunch of other questions that you need\n"
"to answer."
msgstr ""
"Якого біса ти тут робиш?! Та байдуже — у мене до тебе\n"
"купа запитань!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: だがその前に一回ぶった斬らせろ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_03"
msgid ""
"Make it easy on yourself and just stand there while I cut\n"
"you up!"
msgstr "Але спершу дай мені разок тебе рубонути!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 無茶苦茶なことをいうじゃないか、久しぶりに会えたのに。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_04"
msgid "Whoa...you're askin' for quite a bit."
msgstr "Ну що ти верзеш? А ми ж так давно не бачилися."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: でも、すごいじゃないか最高賞金首だなんて、
#. JA:   今は皆が「ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ」を狙ってる。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_05"
msgid ""
"I have to say though...there's enough money on your head\n"
"to buy a small country. A whole lot of people are looking\n"
"for \"Ragna the Bloodedge\"."
msgstr ""
"Але вражає: за твою голову призначили найвищу\n"
"нагороду. Тепер усі полюють на Раґну Бладеджа."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: テメェには関係ねぇ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_06"
msgid "That's got nothin' to do with you!"
msgstr "Тебе це не стосується!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: でも、安心して。もう誰にも手は出させないから。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_07"
msgid ""
"Aaah, but don't worry. I won't let anyone else touch you...\n"
"You're all mine."
msgstr "Та не хвилюйся. Я більше нікому не дам тебе скривдити."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ジン、テメェ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_08"
msgid "You son of a bitch!"
msgstr "Джіне, ти..."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ははっ、いいね、いいよ。いいよこの感覚、忘れてた。
#. JA:   まさかまた会えるなんて……また、”殺せる”なんて。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_09"
msgid ""
"Ahaha! Yes, that's it... I'd almost forgotten this feeling...\n"
"To think that we'd meet like this again...that I'd have the\n"
"chance to \"kill\" you again."
msgstr ""
"Ха-ха, чудово, чудово. Я вже забув це відчуття. Подумати\n"
"лишень, ми знову зустрілися... і я знову можу тебе «вбити»."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: クックックッ……さあ、殺ろうか――兄さん！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_10"
msgid ""
"Hehehe... Enough nostalgia...\n"
"Let's kill each other...Ragna!"
msgstr "Хе-хе-хе... То почнімо — братику!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: グハッ……グッ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_11"
msgid "Hurgh...gah..."
msgstr "Ґха... кх..."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: トドメは刺さねぇぞ、
#. JA:   テメェには聞かせてもらわなきゃなんねぇことがあるからな。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_12"
msgid ""
"I'm not gonna finish you off this time, asshole. I still got a\n"
"lotta questions, and I think you've got the answers."
msgstr ""
"Не добиватиму тебе. Ти ще маєш багато чого мені\n"
"розповісти."

#. Key: ArcEveRG02_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: それに、今回の目的はテメェじゃねぇんだよ。話はまた後でだ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG02_13"
msgid ""
"But, I got bigger fish to fry than you right now, so how\n"
"'bout we continue this chat later?"
msgstr ""
"Та цього разу я прийшов не по тебе. Поговоримо іншим\n"
"разом."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 来たか―――。久しいな、黒き者よ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_00"
msgid "At last, fiend. You finally show yourself."
msgstr "Ти прийшов... Давно не бачилися, чорний."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 久しい？何いってんだ、テメェは。一体何者だ？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_01"
msgid ""
"At last? The hell are you talking about?\n"
"Who are you?"
msgstr "Давно? Якого біса ти верзеш? Ти взагалі хто?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 吼えるな小僧、貴様に謂った訳では無い。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_02"
msgid "I'm not talking to you."
msgstr "Не гарчи, хлопче. Я говорив не до тебе."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: わけわかんねぇし。テメェは馬鹿か？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_03"
msgid "Then who the hell are you talking to? Yourself?"
msgstr "Нічого не второпаю. Ти що, сам з собою балакаєш?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: おら、邪魔だどけ。仮装パーティーなら他の場所でやんな。
#. JA:   悪ィけど時間がねーんだよ、うだうだしてっとぶった斬るぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_04"
msgid ""
"Whatever. I don't have time for you or your shit.\n"
"Now get outta my way, or I'm gonna rip that stupid mask\n"
"off and make you eat it."
msgstr ""
"Гей, не заважай, відійди. Маскарад влаштовуй деінде.\n"
"Вибач, але часу обмаль: будеш телитися — розрубаю."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 為らば何故、剣を抜かない？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_05"
msgid "Then why don't you draw your sword?"
msgstr "Тоді чому не витягаєш меча?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: るせえぞ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_06"
msgid "Shut up."
msgstr "Заткнися."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: それが恐怖だ、ラグナ＝ザ＝ブラッドエッジ。
#. JA:   貴様の中に眠る「モノ」が、私に戦慄する。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_07"
msgid ""
"Aaahh, yes, now that is fear, Ragna the Bloodedge.\n"
"The creature that sleeps within you...it can sense my\n"
"power, and it is afraid."
msgstr ""
"Це страх, Раґно Бладедж. «Дещо», що спить у тобі,\n"
"тремтить переді мною."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: なんだと、テメェ！？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_08"
msgid "What did you say!?"
msgstr "Що ти сказав?!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 黒の焦点にして悪の元凶。
#. JA:   貴様の存在は此の世界に於いて全てを狂わす悪夢だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_09"
msgid ""
"It is the center of darkness and the source of all evil.\n"
"Your very existence is the world's worst nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Осередок пітьми й джерело зла. Твоє існування — кошмар,\n"
"що спотворює все в цьому світі."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: だが、貴様の死に依り黒き縁も途切れよう、
#. JA:   悠久の旅路も此処で終焉だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_10"
msgid ""
"Only your death can put an end to this nightmare.\n"
"It is time for the eternal wanderer to meet his demise."
msgstr ""
"Та з твоєю смертю урветься й чорний зв'язок. Твоя вічна\n"
"мандрівка скінчиться тут."

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: はっ、俺が悪夢ときたか！んで、陶酔しきった前口上は終わりか？
#. JA:   いいぜ、正義の味方気取ってねぇでさっさと来いよ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_11"
msgid ""
"Hah! So now I'm a nightmare? I'm gettin' tired of listening\n"
"to your nonsense. Why don't you drop the hero crap, so\n"
"we can get this over with!?"
msgstr ""
"Ха, то я вже кошмар! Ну що, закінчив свою самозакохану\n"
"промову? Гаразд, годі вдавати героя — нападай уже!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 我は空、我は鋼、我は刃
#. JA:   我は一振りの剣にて全ての「罪」を刈り取り「悪」を滅する！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_12"
msgid ""
"I am the white void. I am the cold steel. I am the just\n"
"sword. With blade in hand shall I reap the sins of this\n"
"world, and cleanse it in the fires of destruction."
msgstr ""
"Я — порожнеча. Я — сталь. Я — лезо... Я єдиним мечем\n"
"пожну всі «гріхи» та знищу «зло»!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_13
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 我が名は「ハクメン」、推して参る！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_13"
msgid "I am Hakumen. The end has come!"
msgstr "Ім'я мені — Хакумен. До бою!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_14
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: クッ、事象干渉か！邪魔をするな化け猫め！！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_14"
msgid "Gah! How dare you interrupt me, Grimalkin!"
msgstr ""
"Кх... Втручання у причинність!? Не ставай мені на заваді,\n"
"клята відьомська кицька!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG03_15
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 口先だけの変人かと思えば。強ぇなんてもんじゃねぇ。
#. JA:   くそっ、何だよ、あれ……。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG03_15"
msgid ""
"I thought he was just some freak that wouldn't shut up...\n"
"but he was pretty tough... Damn it...what the hell is he...?"
msgstr ""
"Я думав, це просто якийсь базікало-псих... Але він не\n"
"просто сильний. Чорт, що це взагалі було?.."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_00
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: チッ、精錬が終わっちまったか。めんどくせぇことになるな。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_00"
msgid ""
"Tch. You gotta be kidding me...\n"
"I guess I was too late."
msgstr "Тц, виплавлення вже завершилося. Тепер буде морока."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 起動・起動・起動・起動・認識……
#. JA:   あーっ、ラグナだ～！久し振りだねっ――４回目だっけ？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_01"
msgid ""
"Loading...loading...loading...loading... Complete...\n"
"Ahh! It's Ragna! I haven't seen you in sooooo long!\n"
"What is this...the fourth time?"
msgstr ""
"Запуск, запуск, запуск, запуск... Ідентифіковано... А-а, це\n"
"Раґна! Давно не бачилися! Учетверте, здається?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ３回目だ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_02"
msgid "Third."
msgstr "Утретє."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ん～、なんだか今日も機嫌悪そうだね。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_03"
msgid "Awwww...looks like somebody's in a bad mood."
msgstr "М-м, ти й сьогодні наче не в гуморі."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_04
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: この前と、その前はちゃんとお話できなかったからかな？
#. JA:   でも、ほら今日はちゃんとお話できる「からだ」だよ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_04"
msgid ""
"Are you mad 'cause we couldn't talk the last few times?\n"
"I've got a body that can talk now, see?"
msgstr ""
"Бо минулого й позаминулого разу ми не змогли нормально\n"
"поговорити? Але дивись: сьогодні в мене є справжнє\n"
"«тіло», здатне говорити!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 前なんかさ、いきなり斬りかかって来たでしょ？
#. JA:   あれ痛かったんだよ、血がいっぱいでて。本当だよ。でもね
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_05"
msgid ""
"You...you remember how you hurt me before?\n"
"It really hurt a lot. I bled a whole bunch. Really!\n"
"But, you know..."
msgstr ""
"Пам'ятаєш, минулого разу ти зненацька мене рубонув?\n"
"Було боляче, крові витекло багато. Справді. Але..."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_06
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: うるせーよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_06"
msgid "Shut up."
msgstr "Заткнися."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: あぁ！ラグナなんか怪我してる！何で回復しないの？
#. JA:   大丈夫？誰が、そんなことしたの？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_07"
msgid ""
"Ah! Ragna, you're injured! Why don't you heal yourself?\n"
"Are you OK? Who did that to you?"
msgstr ""
"А-а! Раґно, тебе поранено! Чому рани не загоюються? Ти\n"
"як? Хто це з тобою зробив?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 黙れ！！その顔で、その声で、俺に話しかけるな！
#. JA:   ……俺は、てめぇを破壊しにきたんだ。わかるな？
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_08"
msgid ""
"Shut up! That face! That voice! Don't you dare talk to me!\n"
"...I'm here to destroy you. Understand?"
msgstr ""
"Замовкни!! Не говори зі мною цим обличчям, цим голосом!\n"
"...Я прийшов знищити тебе. Зрозуміло?"

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: えーっ！！　ラグナ、そんなことしちゃやだ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_09"
msgid "Whaa! Ragna! Don't do that! That's so mean!"
msgstr "Е-е?! Раґно, не треба! Не роби цього!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_10
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: やっと、やっとちゃんとした「からだ」になれたのに、
#. JA:   やっと一緒になれるのに、ひどいよ、やだよ、やだよぅ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_10"
msgid ""
"I finally...I finally have a body. We can finally be together,\n"
"but you...you... You're so mean..."
msgstr ""
"Я нарешті... нарешті отримала справжнє «тіло». Ми\n"
"нарешті можемо бути разом, а ти... Це жорстоко. Не хочу...\n"
"не хочу-у..."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_11
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 今さら許せとはいわねぇ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_11"
msgid "It's too late for me to ask for your forgiveness."
msgstr "Не проситиму пробачити мене — для цього вже запізно."

#. Key: ArcEveRG04_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ……ふ～ん。じゃあ無理矢理にでもお話してもらおうかな。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG04_12"
msgid ""
"...Don't wanna talk, hmm? Perhaps you'll open up after\n"
"something a bit more...physical?"
msgstr "Гм... Тоді доведеться змусити тебе поговорити зі мною."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_01
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: くそっ！……なぜだ、テメェ！！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_01"
msgid "Dammit! Why...!?"
msgstr "Чорт! Чому?! Чому ти...?!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_02
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 無理だよ、無理なんだ。誰にも変えられないんだよ。
#. JA:   これは予定調和、ラグナとニューが一つになる為の通過儀式。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_02"
msgid ""
"It's impossible, you know. No one can change what\n"
"happened. This is destiny! You and are I supposed to\n"
"be together."
msgstr ""
"Неможливо. Нічого не вийде. Ніхто не здатен цього\n"
"змінити. Це визначений наперед хід подій — обряд, після\n"
"якого Раґна й Ню стануть одним цілим."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_03
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 誰にも変えられない物語の終焉。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_03"
msgid "It's a story that can't be rewritten."
msgstr "Кінець історії, якого ніхто не може змінити."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_04_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 何ほざいてやがる
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_04_0"
msgid "The hell are you talking about!?"
msgstr "Що за маячню ти верзеш?!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_04_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 先のことをてめぇに決められる筋合いなんざねぇんだよ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_04_1"
msgid "I don't need anyone telling me what to do!"
msgstr "Не тобі вирішувати, що на мене чекає!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_05
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: グハッ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_05"
msgid "Guhah!"
msgstr "Ґха!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_06_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: そう、ここはラグナとニューが溶け合う場所。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_06_0"
msgid "...And we fall into each other's arms..."
msgstr "Так. Тут Раґна і Ню зіллються воєдино."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_06_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ああ、すごく気持ちいいよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_06_1"
msgid "Oh, this is so romantic."
msgstr "А-а, як же приємно."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_07
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ふざけるな、このカスが……！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_07"
msgid "Let go of me...you bastard...!"
msgstr "Не верзи дурниць, тварюка...!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_08
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: グハァッ！
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_08"
msgid "Guagh!"
msgstr "Ґха-а!"

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_09
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ラグナとニューの命は一つなんだよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_09"
msgid "Your life and my life are the same."
msgstr "Життя Раґни й Ню — одне на двох."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_10_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ニューが死ななければラグナは絶対に死なないの
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_10_0"
msgid "If I'm still alive, you definitely won't die."
msgstr "Поки Ню не помре, Раґна нізащо не помре."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_10_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: そしてそれはニューも同じ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_10_1"
msgid "The same goes for me too."
msgstr "І з Ню так само."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_11_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 熱いうねりに身をゆだねて、ひとつになる。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_11_0"
msgid "You can't fight your feelings, Ragna."
msgstr "Віддайся гарячому потоку — і ми станемо одним цілим."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_11_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ずっとずっと、一緒だよ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_11_1"
msgid "We're going to be together...forever and always."
msgstr "Назавжди-навзавжди разом."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_12
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: やめ、ろ……俺は……。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_12"
msgid "Stop...it... I'm...not..."
msgstr "При... пини... Я..."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_13_0
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: さあ、一緒に全てを壊そう
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_13_0"
msgid "All right, let's go destroy everything now. "
msgstr "Нумо разом усе зруйнуємо."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_13_1
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: 憎い憎いこの世界を壊そう
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_13_1"
msgid "Destroy this whole terrible, awful excuse for a world."
msgstr "Зруйнуймо цей ненависний, ненависний світ."

#. Key: ArcEveRG05_13_2
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG01 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG02 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG03 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG04 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Source: system/ArcEveRG_ArcEveRG05 (data/ETC/Text_Eng/ArcEveRG.pac)
#. Speaker: Nu
#. Context: Arcade event: Ragna
#. JA: ね、ラグナ。
msgctxt "ArcEveRG05_13_2"
msgid "OK? Ragna?"
msgstr "Так, Раґно?"
